{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":696187,\"title\":\"Chuckwagon\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Focusing on the sport of chuckwagon racing at the Calgary Stampede, captured through a mix of aerial, POV, and ringside footage, the film is ahead of its time in the way it captures adrenaline-pumping action. This short documentary offers a ringside view of the chuckwagon race, star attraction of the world-famous Calgary Stampede. Once ponderous Percheron and Clydesdale draught thundered around the course. Now they are racers, and it takes a firm hand to guide such horsepower.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6ByynZk0sTYyISJjJjgXYdeBkWD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fn9HvpOjtq10D9f4MGMGbudjN6D.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":1964,\"runtime\":10,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Western\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Robert Barclay\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2611876,\"name\":\"Robert Barclay\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1236153,\"name\":\"John Drainie\",\"character\":\"Narrator\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oHTlp7J0I7uQzGq5AJWwePXgBsM.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":273709,\"title\":\"Seabiscuit: The Lost Documentary\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lnhYXf8AoJnugcOu1cuKA3s3q4i.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Made in 1939 by Seabiscuit's owner Charles Howard.  This inspirational film chronicles Seabiscuit's life from birth, through training, and the legendary match race with War Admiral.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6977,\"title\":\"No Country for Old Men\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6d5XOczc226jECq0LIX0siKtgHR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fCCvn3xsG29TGKJPvZgTRppsDgk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Llewelyn Moss stumbles upon dead bodies, $2 million and a hoard of heroin in a Texas desert, but methodical killer Anton Chigurh comes looking for it, with local sheriff Ed Tom Bell hot on his trail. The roles of prey and predator blur as the violent pursuit of money and justice collide.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":273248,\"title\":\"The Hateful Eight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jIywvdPjia2t3eKYbjVTcwBQlG8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7g1zO5t0bd27Iqn5ZUDJmksOGPJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bounty hunters seek shelter from a raging blizzard and get caught up in a plot of betrayal and deception.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1439109,\"title\":\"Iron Winter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7F8PSQ6lmczdiNHB0EIOklG2iU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o4ddWhd0GsILhrKZRaPC4L6MlWP.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Iron Winter follows two young Mongolian horse herders who battle extreme winter cold to protect an ancient tradition that risks being lost forever. Set in the Tsakhir Valley of the Arkhangai province, one of the world's harshest human-inhabited environments, the film captures the herders' 150-day struggle to lead thousands of horses into the high country in search of edible grass hidden under the snow.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8584,\"title\":\"Shanghai Noon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b0WwWRcDiDahkah5vZ0KjB4N9ZZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xuwPmDMHslcx71T7zHc9YqF2Ny3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Chon Wang, a clumsy imperial guard, trails Princess Pei Pei when she's kidnapped from the Forbidden City and transported to America. Wang follows her captors to Nevada, where he teams up with an unlikely partner, outcast outlaw Roy O'Bannon, and tries to spring the princess from her imprisonment.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":16405,\"title\":\"Dust\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qhNlFTwlrte13wX3ntMQJSO7azG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lba63vslUgCsRCumTNy5XYKTyVP.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two parallel tales of redemption, a century apart. In the New York storyline, Edge hunts for Angela's gold to pay back a debt, and gradually grows closer to her. In the Macedonian story, the brothers end up fighting for opposite sides of a revolution, with the religious Elijah taking up sides with the Ottoman sultan and gunslinger Luke joining \\\"the Teacher\\\" , a Macedonian rebel.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":476833,\"title\":\"Branded\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5gsFeZG69db19iBjImfikgYnZGQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x8zD8EArSaai7NCjT8rDriiwAg1.jpg\",\"rating\":3,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In this post-apocalyptic-western, Alexander Dante has lived the past 10 years in exile for the killing of Edwin, his beloved brother. Then one day he's astounded to receive a letter, purportedly from Edwin. The letter states Edwin now lives in the distant village shown on the enclosed map. At first, Alexander dismisses the letter as a hoax but there's something about the letter that rings true. He treks through a hard and hostile land that at long last opens up into a tranquil village. There, he's stunned to confront the impossible: his brother is very much alive. Alexander is overjoyed to see his brother but he is tormented as he knows he has killed him. Now Alexander must root out the truth -- whatever the consequences.\",\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":860610,\"title\":\"Halter Off\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5orklx6dyTpx2x69zZ0ckwcOZaP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Set in Charles Town, West Virginia, Halter Off offers an unapologetic look at one man's shot at a second chance. Angelo Jackson, a 50-year old horse trainer with a checkered past, is looking to redeem himself after being one charge away from a life sentence in prison. Banned from the track and with the odds against him, Angelo is facing the biggest race of his career against mentor and legendary horse trainer, James W. Casey. As Angelo finds himself downs on his luck and with the system he is working for working against him, he puts it all on the line to win the race of his life.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":667338,\"title\":\"Glitter and Dust\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AwcEbIdVP81PzJEyPfz7AB2MWVL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Four girls living in the lonely vastness of the USA share one passion: The wild world of rodeo. Although they move about in the powerful imagery of the American prairie and the myths of the Wild West, they give it new resonance and break free of it. In a world which used to belong to their fathers and brothers, they prove that \\\"you ride like a girl\\\" is not an insult but a compliment.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":855160,\"title\":\"Back in the Saddle: Face Off with the Flood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ebbkEAFXZDvNARFKHSPtMvkD2Au.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A dramatic one hour documentary, telling the behind-the-scenes story of the Calgary Flames efforts to get their home back in time for the season opener after the catastrophic 2013 Calgary flood.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"mIKTvEc5sxI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"HUo5eq2jiAQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"iRDDs7owcro\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}